<title>USA: PAXAR CORP BOARD SETS 25 PCT STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>PAXAR CORP BOARD SETS 25 PCT STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PAXAR Corp said Thursday that its board of directors declared a stock dividend of 25 percent payable to shareholders of recored as of Aug 21.</p>
<p>The company said payment will be made on Sept 9, and will result in outstanding common shares increasing to approximately 36 million shares.</p>
<p>PAXAR said this was the 26th dividend payment in the past 21 years.</p>
